    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Beachfront Opportunity in the Heart of Kilkee\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial four-bedroom residence in a truly enviable beachfront position in the heart of the picturesque coastal town of Kilkee, West Clare. Situated directly opposite the beach, the property enjoys an outstanding location with magnificent sea views and all the amenities of this popular seaside town literally on its doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhile the property now requires complete renovation, it offers tremendous potential for the discerning purchaser to create a superb permanent home, holiday residence or coastal retreat finished entirely to their own standards. The front reception rooms enjoy glorious views across the sea, providing a wonderful setting from which to appreciate the ever-changing coastal scenery.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n\r\nThe accommodation currently comprises an entrance area, kitchen, bathroom, five bedrooms and three reception rooms, with the front rooms taking full advantage of the property's exceptional coastal outlook. The property also benefits from full planning permission for renovation and extension, providing an exciting opportunity to substantially enhance and modernise the existing dwelling while creating a home perfectly suited to the purchaser's requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from side access and a small courtyard area to the rear, providing valuable outdoor space and potential for landscaping and further enhancement.\r\n\r\nThe location is difficult to surpass. Positioned in the heart of Kilkee and immediately opposite the famous sandy beach, the new owner will enjoy easy access to a wide range of local amenities, including pubs, restaurants, cafés, supermarkets, schools, library and a host of sporting and leisure facilities. Kilkee is renowned for its spectacular coastline and offers an array of water-based activities, while the local golf course further adds to the area's appeal."
      },
